{"id":"claim:evidential/hawe-ne-reportative--hawe-diachrony-from-voice","revision":1,"topic":"topic:evidential/hawe-ne-reportative","topics":["topic:evidential/hawe-ne-reportative","topic:evidential/hawe-ne-reportative--diachrony"],"statement":{"en":"The reportative evidential marker hawe developed diachronically from expressions meaning 'there is a voice of...' or 'there is a rumor of...'.","ja":"伝聞証拠性形式 hawe は、「…の声がある」「…の噂がある」といった意味から通時的に転じて成立した。"},"type":"diachrony","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:ainu"],"quantifier":"all","modality":"epistemic","conditions":[]},"forms":["hawe","hau"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:hirosawa2026@pdftotext-pieces/l0002-11","stance":"reports"},{"id":"stmt:kindaichi1936@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0202-03","stance":"proposes"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-13-12-354Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:evidential/hawe-ne-reportative--the-particle-manu-functions-as-an-indirect-narrative","revision":1,"topic":"topic:evidential/hawe-ne-reportative","topics":["topic:evidential/hawe-ne-reportative"],"statement":{"en":"The particle manu functions as an indirect narrative marker ('...that...') or as an expletive (filler) particle.","ja":"manu は間接叙法「……と」を表すか、または添辞（expletive）として用いられる。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":[],"quantifier":"unstated","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["manu"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:kindaichi1936@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0163-01","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-13-12-354Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:evidential/hawe-ne-reportative--when-a-quote-reports-hearsay-ari-is-used","revision":1,"topic":"topic:evidential/hawe-ne-reportative","topics":["topic:evidential/hawe-ne-reportative"],"statement":{"en":"When a quote reports hearsay, ari is used together with the existential verb an.","ja":"引用が伝聞である場合、ariは存在動詞anとともに用いられる。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido/southwest/shizunai"],"quantifier":"generic","modality":"actual","conditions":["when the quote is of hearsay"]},"forms":["ari","an"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:refsing1986@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0259-07","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-13-12-354Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:evidential/hawe-ne-reportative--the-auxiliary-manu-is-said-to-be-like","revision":1,"topic":"topic:evidential/hawe-ne-reportative","topics":["topic:evidential/hawe-ne-reportative"],"statement":{"en":"The auxiliary manu 'is said to be, like' does not occur at sentence-final position, and its use is almost entirely restricted to expressions like kamuy ne manu p.","ja":"manu「〜と言われる、〜のような」は文末には現れず、また、ほぼ kamuy ne manu p のような表現に限られる。"},"type":"distribution","scope":{"doculects":[],"quantifier":"usually","modality":"necessary","conditions":[]},"forms":["manu"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:sato2008@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0101-02","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-13-12-354Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:evidential/hawe-ne-reportative--the-hearsay-marker-yakaye-it-is-said-can","revision":1,"topic":"topic:evidential/hawe-ne-reportative","topics":["topic:evidential/hawe-ne-reportative"],"statement":{"en":"The hearsay marker yakaye 'it is said' can be morphologically analyzed as the quotative conjunction yak plus the indefinite transitive verb form a-ye 'people say'.","ja":"伝聞を表す yakaye「そうだ」は、引用の yak「〜と」と他動詞の不定人称形 a-ye「人が言う」からなる不定人称文として分析できる。"},"type":"analysis","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido"],"quantifier":"generic","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["yakaye","yak","a-ye"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:sato2008@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0220-02","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-13-12-354Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:evidential/hawe-ne-reportative--in-some-cases-the-existential-verb-an-may","revision":1,"topic":"topic:evidential/hawe-ne-reportative","topics":["topic:evidential/hawe-ne-reportative","topic:evidential/hawe-ne-reportative--diachrony"],"statement":{"en":"In some cases, the existential verb an may substitute for the copula ne in the hawe-based reportive evidential construction.","ja":"haweに基づく伝聞証拠構文において、繋辞neの代わりに存在動詞anが代用されることがある。"},"type":"alternation","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido/southwest"],"quantifier":"exists","modality":"possible","conditions":[]},"forms":["an","ne","hawe"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:bugaeva2008@pdftotext-pieces/l0041-02","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-13-12-354Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:evidential/hawe-ne-reportative--haw-e-originally-means-voice-but-when-used","revision":1,"topic":"topic:evidential/hawe-ne-reportative","topics":["topic:evidential/hawe-ne-reportative","topic:evidential/hawe-ne-reportative--diachrony"],"statement":{"en":"haw(e) originally means 'voice', but when used in sentence-final phrases, its meaning is primarily restricted to what has been confirmed through words (verbal communication).","ja":"haw(e) は本来「声」を表すが、文末句で用いられた場合、意味はおもに「言葉によって確認したこと」に限定される。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:ainu"],"quantifier":"generic","modality":"actual","conditions":["in sentence-final phrases"]},"forms":["hawe","haw"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:nakagawa2024@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0394-02","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-13-12-354Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:evidential/hawe-ne-reportative--in-the-saru-and-chitose-dialects-hawe-ne","revision":1,"topic":"topic:evidential/hawe-ne-reportative","topics":["topic:evidential/hawe-ne-reportative","topic:evidential/hawe-ne-reportative--diachrony"],"statement":{"en":"In the Saru and Chitose dialects, hawe ne can be used when the speaker explains what they themselves have just said.","ja":"沙流方言や千歳方言では、今自分の言ったことを説明する場合に hawe ne を用いることができる。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido/southwest/saru","doculect:hokkaido/chitose"],"quantifier":"generic","modality":"possible","conditions":["explaining what the speaker has just said"]},"forms":["hawe ne"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:nakagawa2024@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0394-03","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-13-12-354Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:evidential/hawe-ne-reportative--ainu-haw-ne-wa-hawe-composed-of-haw","revision":1,"topic":"topic:evidential/hawe-ne-reportative","topics":["topic:evidential/hawe-ne-reportative","topic:evidential/hawe-ne-reportative--double-evid"],"statement":{"en":"Ainu haw-ne wa hawe, composed of haw 'voice', copula ne, conjunction wa 'and', and the reportative evidential hawe, means 'they say that the rumor is that...'.","ja":"アイヌ語haw-ne wa haweは、haw「声」、コピュラne、接続詞wa、伝聞証拠性形式haweから成り、「…という噂だそうだ」を意味する。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:ainu"],"quantifier":"generic","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["haw-ne wa hawe","haw","ne","wa","hawe"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:vovin2022@handbook-epub/l0041-02","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-13-12-354Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:evidential/hawe-ne-reportative--hawe-is-used-in-interrogative-sentences","revision":1,"topic":"topic:evidential/hawe-ne-reportative","topics":["topic:evidential/hawe-ne-reportative","topic:evidential/hawe-ne-reportative--frames"],"statement":{"en":"hawe is used in interrogative sentences.","ja":"hawe は疑問文に用いられる。"},"type":"distribution","scope":{"doculects":[],"quantifier":"unstated","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["hawe"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:kindaichi1936@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0202-04","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-13-12-354Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:evidential/hawe-ne-reportative--hawe-an-plural-hawe-okai-expresses-a-question","revision":1,"topic":"topic:evidential/hawe-ne-reportative","topics":["topic:evidential/hawe-ne-reportative","topic:evidential/hawe-ne-reportative--frames"],"statement":{"en":"hawe-an (plural hawe-okai) expresses a question (or exclamation).","ja":"hawe-an（複数形 hawe-okai）は疑問（あるいは感嘆）を表す。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":[],"quantifier":"unstated","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["hawe-an","hawe-okai"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:kindaichi1936@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0203-03","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-13-12-354Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:evidential/hawe-ne-reportative--hawe-an-is-used-in-questions-asking-about","revision":1,"topic":"topic:evidential/hawe-ne-reportative","topics":["topic:evidential/hawe-ne-reportative","topic:evidential/hawe-ne-reportative--frames"],"statement":{"en":"hawe an is used in questions asking about information obtained through words.","ja":"hawe an は言葉によって得た情報についての質問の場合に使われる。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:ainu"],"quantifier":"generic","modality":"actual","conditions":["asking about verbally received information"]},"forms":["hawe an"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:nakagawa2024@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0395-01","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-13-12-354Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:evidential/hawe-ne-reportative--the-combination-hawe-ne-functions-as-an-assertive","revision":1,"topic":"topic:evidential/hawe-ne-reportative","topics":["topic:evidential/hawe-ne-reportative","topic:evidential/hawe-ne-reportative--frames"],"statement":{"en":"The combination hawe ne functions as an assertive sentence-final form.","ja":"hawe ne は文末の断定形式として機能する。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido/southwest/shizunai"],"quantifier":"generic","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["hawe ne"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:refsing1986@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0230-03","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-13-12-354Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:evidential/hawe-ne-reportative--a-general-hearsay-report-can-be-encoded-by","revision":1,"topic":"topic:evidential/hawe-ne-reportative","topics":["topic:evidential/hawe-ne-reportative","topic:evidential/hawe-ne-reportative--hawe-as"],"statement":{"en":"A general hearsay report can be encoded by the quotative sekor followed by the avalent verb haw-as 'voice-stand'.","ja":"一般的な伝聞報告は、引用詞sekorの後に無価動詞haw-as「声が立つ」が続くことによって表される。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:ainu"],"quantifier":"generic","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["sekor","haw-as"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:bugaeva2008@pdftotext-pieces/l0040-02","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-13-12-354Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:evidential/hawe-ne-reportative--haw-e-ash-expresses-hearsay-reportative-modality-so","revision":1,"topic":"topic:evidential/hawe-ne-reportative","topics":["topic:evidential/hawe-ne-reportative","topic:evidential/hawe-ne-reportative--hawe-as"],"statement":{"en":"haw(e)-ash expresses hearsay / reportative modality ('so I hear' / 'it is said that ...').","ja":"haw(e)-ash は聞説（「…さうだ」）を表す。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":[],"quantifier":"unstated","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["hawe-ash","haw-ash"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:kindaichi1936@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0203-02","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-13-12-354Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:evidential/hawe-ne-reportative--the-verb-h-was-is-literally-interpreted-as","revision":1,"topic":"topic:evidential/hawe-ne-reportative","topics":["topic:evidential/hawe-ne-reportative","topic:evidential/hawe-ne-reportative--hawe-as"],"statement":{"en":"The verb háwas is literally interpreted as haw 'voice' plus as 'stand', and is used as an impersonal expression meaning 'people say' or 'it is said', obscuring who is speaking.","ja":"háwas は逐語的には haw「声」, as「立つ」と解釈され、「人が言う，そう言われる」のように、誰が言っているのかをぼかした言い方として用いられる。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido"],"quantifier":"generic","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["háwas","haw","as"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:sato2008@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0343-01","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-13-12-354Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:evidential/hawe-ne-reportative--in-the-n-penepo-expression-the-form-h","revision":1,"topic":"topic:evidential/hawe-ne-reportative","topics":["topic:evidential/hawe-ne-reportative","topic:evidential/hawe-ne-reportative--hawe-as"],"statement":{"en":"In the népenepo ... expression, the form háwas is used when the perception is based on audition.","ja":"népenepo 〜 の表現において、聴覚に基づく場合には háwas という形式が用いられる。"},"type":"distribution","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido"],"quantifier":"generic","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["háwas"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:sato2008@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0344-01","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-13-12-354Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:evidential/hawe-ne-reportative--the-hearsay-particle-construction-manuyke-it-is-said","revision":1,"topic":"topic:evidential/hawe-ne-reportative","topics":["topic:evidential/hawe-ne-reportative","topic:evidential/hawe-ne-reportative--paradigm"],"statement":{"en":"The hearsay particle construction manuyke 'it is said that...' is treated as a single word rather than being divided into separate elements.","ja":"伝聞の manuyke「〜だそうで」は分離されず、一語として扱われる。"},"type":"analysis","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:sakhalin"],"quantifier":"unstated","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["manuyke"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:murasaki2025@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0007-04","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-13-12-354Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:evidential/hawe-ne-reportative--the-auxiliary-verb-manu-expresses-hearsay-or-folktale","revision":1,"topic":"topic:evidential/hawe-ne-reportative","topics":["topic:evidential/hawe-ne-reportative","topic:evidential/hawe-ne-reportative--paradigm"],"statement":{"en":"The auxiliary verb manu expresses hearsay or folktale reportative evidentiality ('it is said that').","ja":"助動詞 manu は《〜とさ》を表す。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:sakhalin"],"quantifier":"generic","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["manu"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:murasaki2025@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0101-06","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-13-12-354Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:evidential/hawe-ne-reportative--southern-hokkaido-ainu-has-a-specialized-reportive-evidential","revision":1,"topic":"topic:evidential/hawe-ne-reportative","topics":["topic:evidential/hawe-ne-reportative","topic:evidential/hawe-ne-reportative--scope"],"statement":{"en":"Southern Hokkaido Ainu has a specialized reportive evidential construction formed by the grammaticalized function word hawe followed by the copula ne, in which the hawe-marked clause is embedded as the object argument of ne.","ja":"北海道南部アイヌ語には文法化した機能語haweと繋辞neの結合によって形成される特殊な伝聞証拠構文が存在し、haweを伴う節がne節の目的語項として埋め込まれる。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido/southwest"],"quantifier":"generic","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["hawe","ne"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:bugaeva2008@pdftotext-pieces/l0041-01","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-13-12-354Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:evidential/hawe-ne-reportative--like-siri-ne-hawe-ne-can-also-be","revision":1,"topic":"topic:evidential/hawe-ne-reportative","topics":["topic:evidential/hawe-ne-reportative","topic:evidential/hawe-ne-reportative--scope"],"statement":{"en":"Like \"siri ne\", \"hawe ne\" can also be used to express an action that has not yet begun (a future action).","ja":"siri ne と同様に、hawe ne にもまだ開始されていない動作（未来の動作）を表す用法がある。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido"],"quantifier":"exists","modality":"possible","conditions":["when referring to an action not yet initiated"]},"forms":["hawe ne"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:hirosawa2026@pdftotext-pieces/l0004-09","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-13-12-354Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:evidential/hawe-ne-reportative--the-complex-predicate-hawe-ne-functions-as-a","revision":1,"topic":"topic:evidential/hawe-ne-reportative","topics":["topic:evidential/hawe-ne-reportative","topic:evidential/hawe-ne-reportative--semantics"],"statement":{"en":"The complex predicate hawe ne functions as a reportative evidential ('it is said that').","ja":"複合述語 hawe ne は伝聞証拠性（「〜とのことである」）を表す。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido/southwest"],"quantifier":"generic","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["hawe ne"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:bugaeva2012@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0019-03","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-13-12-354Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:evidential/hawe-ne-reportative--in-tamura-1997-hawe-ne-is-described-as","revision":1,"topic":"topic:evidential/hawe-ne-reportative","topics":["topic:evidential/hawe-ne-reportative","topic:evidential/hawe-ne-reportative--semantics"],"statement":{"en":"In Tamura (1997), \"hawe ne\" is described as being used when speaking based on what someone said, such as introducing what another person said or further explaining one's own words.","ja":"田村（1997）によれば、hawe ne は他人が言ったことを紹介する場合や自分が言ったことをさらに説明する場合など、だれかが言ったことに基づいて述べる場合に用いられる。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":[],"quantifier":"generic","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["hawe ne"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:hirosawa2026@pdftotext-pieces/l0003-02","stance":"reports"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-13-12-354Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:evidential/hawe-ne-reportative--in-nakagawa-s-1995-dictionary-of-the-chitose","revision":1,"topic":"topic:evidential/hawe-ne-reportative","topics":["topic:evidential/hawe-ne-reportative","topic:evidential/hawe-ne-reportative--semantics"],"statement":{"en":"In Nakagawa's (1995) dictionary of the Chitose dialect, \"hawe ne\" is defined as a sentence-final particle indicating that something was judged based on verbal information, and it can also be used to explain or confirm the meaning of one's own utterance.","ja":"中川（1995）の千歳方言辞典において、hawe ne は言葉による情報で判断されたことを示す文末詞と定義され、また自分の発言の意味を説明・確認する場合にも用いられる。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido/chitose"],"quantifier":"generic","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["hawe ne"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:hirosawa2026@pdftotext-pieces/l0003-07","stance":"reports"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-13-12-354Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:evidential/hawe-ne-reportative--the-form-hawe-ne-typically-marks-auditory-spoken","revision":1,"topic":"topic:evidential/hawe-ne-reportative","topics":["topic:evidential/hawe-ne-reportative","topic:evidential/hawe-ne-reportative--semantics"],"statement":{"en":"The form \"hawe ne\" typically marks auditory/spoken information.","ja":"hawe ne は音声情報を標示する典型的な用法をもつ。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido"],"quantifier":"usually","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["hawe ne"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:hirosawa2026@pdftotext-pieces/l0004-08","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-13-12-354Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:evidential/hawe-ne-reportative--bunsai-h-states-an-event-as-mere-hearsay","revision":1,"topic":"topic:evidential/hawe-ne-reportative","topics":["topic:evidential/hawe-ne-reportative","topic:evidential/hawe-ne-reportative--semantics"],"statement":{"en":"Bunsai-hō states an event as mere hearsay.","ja":"聞説法は単なる伝聞として述べるものである。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":[],"quantifier":"generic","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["hawe-ne"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:kindaichi1936@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0193-02","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-13-12-354Z","status":"grouped"}
